{'symbol': 'BG', 'date': '2021-08-05 15:48:00', 'title': 'BUNGE LIMITED DECLARES DIVIDENDS ON COMMON AND PREFERENCE SHARES', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BUNGE LIMITED (NYSE: BG) ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.525 PER COMMON SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 2, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOVEMBER 18, 2021. THE COMPANY ALSO DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.21875 PER SHARE ON ITS 4.875% CUMULATIVE CONVERTIBLE PERPETUAL PREFERENCE SHARES, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 1, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOVEMBER 15, 2021. ABOUT BUNGE AT BUNGE (WWW'}